{"id":"620837","name":"鲍鱼拌黄瓜","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/620837/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲍鱼","amount":"4个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"一根"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"陈醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒红油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲍鱼刷洗干净。","img":"images/620837/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去壳去内脏，牙齿。","img":"images/620837/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成片。","img":"images/620837/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜拍一下，切成小段。","img":"images/620837/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黄椒，红椒。","img":"images/620837/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"水开鲍鱼焯一分钟捞出。","img":"images/620837/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"黄瓜，鲍鱼放大碗里。","img":"images/620837/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"黄椒，红椒放入。","img":"images/620837/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，陈醋，香油，辣椒油调个料汁。","img":"images/620837/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"浇入碗中。","img":"images/620837/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/620837/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/620837/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/620837/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}